---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Case
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : student requests support
    [*] --> assigned : advisor opens a case (outreach)
    pending --> assigned : Programme Head assigns an advisor
    assigned --> contacted : advisor met the student
    assigned --> referred : advisor refers the case
    contacted --> referred : advisor refers the case
    followUp --> referred : advisor refers the case
    referred --> assigned : another advisor accepts the referral
    referred --> assigned : receiver returns it (back to the previous stage)
    referred --> contacted : receiver returns it (back to the previous stage)
    referred --> followUp : advisor follows up after the welfare work
    contacted --> followUp : advisor follows up
    assigned --> closed : advisor closes
    contacted --> closed : advisor closes
    followUp --> closed : advisor closes
    closed --> assigned : advisor reopens (status reopened)
    note right of closed
        status = closed and closedAt set
        a reassignment or an approved change request
        keeps the stage and is logged as a hand-over
    end note
